    "description": "Your ability to perceive motives and intentions is very accurate. If combat is about to begin, make a DC 20 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> check. If successful, you gain a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Swift_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Swift Action\">Swift Action</a> before <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative</a> is rolled. You are also not considered <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flat-Footed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flat-Footed\">Flat-Footed</a> at the beginning of combat. Even if you fail the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> check, you are still not <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Flat-Footed\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Flat-Footed\">Flat-Footed</a>.",
